  <section class="ip17-intent" id="ip17-intent"><div><p class="ip17-kicker">01 / VISUAL INTENT</p><h2>不是堆叠高光，<br>而是控制每一道反射。</h2></div><div class="ip17-intent-copy"><p>本项目围绕一款高度精密、表面关系复杂的旗舰手机建立完整产品视觉语言。核心不是制造夸张效果，而是用轮廓光、渐变反射和微距景深解释结构。</p><dl><div><dt>SUBJECT</dt><dd>iPhone 17 Pro Max · 深蓝色</dd></div><div><dt>FOCUS</dt><dd>结构准确 · 材质区分 · 商业布光</dd></div><div><dt>DELIVERABLE</dt><dd>Hero · Detail · Material · Atmosphere</dd></div><div><dt>PROJECT TYPE</dt><dd>Independent Product Visualization</dd></div></dl></div></section>
  <section class="ip17-hero-shot" id="ip17-hero-shot"><header class="ip17-section-head light"><p class="ip17-kicker">02 / HERO RENDERING</p><h2>用一个角度，<br>建立产品的第一印象。</h2><p>三分之二背侧视角同时交代机身比例、横向摄像平台、边缘过渡与表面反射。</p></header><div class="ip17-wide-canvas ip17-slot" data-slot="HERO RENDER · 16:9"><div class="ip17-grid"></div><div class="ip17-device hero-wide"><div class="ip17-camera-plate"><i></i><i></i><i></i><b></b></div></div><div class="ip17-shot-note"><span>CAMERA</span><b>85 MM</b><span>LIGHT</span><b>SOFT EDGE</b></div></div></section>
  <section class="ip17-detail" id="ip17-detail"><header class="ip17-section-head"><p class="ip17-kicker">03 / PRECISION DETAILS</p><h2>让结构经得起靠近。</h2><p>细节画面将分别验证镜头平台、边缘曲率、按键接缝和屏幕边界，避免用氛围掩盖模型问题。</p></header><div class="ip17-detail-grid"><figure class="ip17-detail-card large ip17-slot" data-slot="CAMERA PLATFORM · 4:3"><div class="detail-lens"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><figcaption><span>01 / OPTICS</span><b>镜头平台与蓝宝石玻璃表面</b></figcaption></figure><figure class="ip17-detail-card ip17-slot" data-slot="EDGE PROFILE · 4:3"><div class="detail-edge"></div><figcaption><span>02 / EDGE</span><b>一体成型机身与连续倒角</b></figcaption></figure><figure class="ip17-detail-card ip17-slot" data-slot="DISPLAY · 4:3"><div class="detail-display"></div><figcaption><span>03 / DISPLAY</span><b>超瓷晶面板与屏幕边界</b></figcaption></figure></div></section>
  <section class="ip17-material" id="ip17-material"><header class="ip17-section-head light"><p class="ip17-kicker">04 / MATERIAL STUDY</p><h2>同一种深蓝，<br>在不同表面呈现不同响应。</h2><p>正式渲染将以同一灯光基准比较铝金属、超瓷晶面板、镜头玻璃与 OLED 屏幕的高光宽度、粗糙度和反射层次。</p></header><div class="ip17-material-grid"><article class="aluminum"><span>01</span><div></div><h3>Aluminum Unibody</h3><p>细腻表面与宽幅柔光</p></article><article class="ceramic"><span>02</span><div></div><h3>Ceramic Shield</h3><p>深色基底与克制镜面反射</p></article><article class="lens"><span>03</span><div></div><h3>Lens Glass</h3><p>多层镀膜与高纯度高光</p></article><article class="display"><span>04</span><div></div><h3>OLED Display</h3><p>低黑位与环境光过渡</p></article></div></section>
  <section class="ip17-process" id="ip17-process"><header class="ip17-section-head"><p class="ip17-kicker">05 / PROCESS EVIDENCE</p><h2>最终画面之前，<br>先把结构、材质与光拆开。</h2><p>这一部分将在正式素材阶段替换为真实制作证据，明确展示建模、材质、布光与后期判断。</p></header><div class="ip17-process-grid"><figure class="ip17-slot" data-slot="CLAY"><div class="process-form clay"></div><figcaption><span>01</span><b>Clay Render</b><small>检查比例和曲面连续性</small></figcaption></figure><figure class="ip17-slot" data-slot="WIREFRAME"><div class="process-form wire"></div><figcaption><span>02</span><b>Wireframe</b><small>检查拓扑和倒角密度</small></figcaption></figure><figure class="ip17-slot" data-slot="LIGHTING"><div class="process-form lighting"></div><figcaption><span>03</span><b>Lighting Setup</b><small>控制轮廓与材质分离</small></figcaption></figure><figure class="ip17-slot" data-slot="FINAL"><div class="process-form final"></div><figcaption><span>04</span><b>Final Grade</b><small>统一色彩和局部对比</small></figcaption></figure></div></section>
  <section class="ip17-atmosphere" id="ip17-atmosphere"><div class="ip17-atmo-copy"><p class="ip17-kicker">06 / ATMOSPHERIC FINALE</p><h2>让产品从黑暗中，<br>被光线准确地看见。</h2><p>低照度背景、柔和轮廓光和有限景深构成最终收束，不依赖多余道具。</p></div><div class="ip17-atmo-stage ip17-slot" data-slot="ATMOSPHERIC SHOT · 16:9"><div class="ip17-atmo-ring"></div><div class="ip17-device atmo-device"><div class="ip17-camera-plate"><i></i><i></i><i></i><b></b></div></div></div></section>
